摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Self-hosted, open-source agent skill registry for enterprises. Publish & version skill packages, govern with RBAC and audit logs, deploy on-premise with Docker or Kubernetes.","id":"gh:1178833585","install_available":false,"language":"Java","name":"skillhub","slug":"iflytek/skillhub","topics":["agent-framework","ai-agent","ai-governance","ai-infrastructure","ai-orchestration","audit-log","dsh-plugin","enterprise-ai","iflytek-astron","openclaw","openclaw-skills","rbac","skill","skill-hub","skill-management","skill-manager","skill-registry","skills","version-control"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Self-hosted, open-source agent skill registry for enterprises. Publish & version skill packages, gov"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ern with RBAC and audit logs, deploy on-premise with Docker or Kubernetes."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"SkillHub\nAn enterprise-grade, open-source agent skill registry — publish, discover, and manage reusa"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"ble skill packages across your organization."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"SkillHub is a self-hosted platform that gives teams a private,\ngoverned place to share agent skills."},{"id":"p4s2","text":" Publish a skill package, push\nit to a namespace, and let others find it through search or\ninstall i"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"t via CLI. Built for on-premise deployment behind your\nfirewall, with the same polish you'd expect f"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"rom a public registry."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> ⭐ If SkillHub fits your team, **star** the repo to help other teams find it, and **Watch → Custom "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"→ Releases** to get notified when a new version ships."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Share Great Skills"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Great Skills become more valuable when they are shared. If you have a Skill that has\nproved useful i"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"n real work or everyday life, share it with the SkillHub community and\nhelp grow an open, practical "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"Skill ecosystem. We welcome Skills for daily life, office\nwork, learning and research, travel and ev"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ents, content creation, data analysis, and\nsoftware development—not only engineering workflows."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"High-quality community contributions may join the curated starter collection, making new\nSkillHub de"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ployments useful from day one. You do not need to finish the full adaptation\nbefore joining in: open"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" an issue\nwith the Skill's source and the problem it solves, or submit a PR by following the\nSkill s"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"h the Skill's source and the problem it solves, or submit a PR by following the\nSkill sharing guide."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **User Guide** — 中文 / English: find, install, and use skills in your agent\n- **CLI reference** — A"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"uthentication, installation, upgrades, namespace synchronization, and local inventory\n- **Skill Suit"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"es** — Install a versioned collection and use its entry skill; Suite Bundle import is the separate a"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"uthoring workflow\n- **Self-hosting** — Docker Compose configuration and upgrades; Kubernetes for clu"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"sters\n- **Developer workflow** — Source development, checks, and documentation maintenance; operatio"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ns reference for deployment details\n- **Generated code overview** — Supplementary architecture explo"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ration; repository source and versioned documentation define current behavior\n- **Python Examples** "},{"id":"p10s8","text":"— Search, download, and publish skills via the REST API"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Governance and Safety"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Privacy and Data Governance** —\nData categories, operator responsibilities, retention, portabili"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ty, and incident\nhandling for public and self-hosted instances\n- **Content Safety** — Package safety"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" expectations,\nreview and reporting controls, appeals, and child-safety responsibilities\n- **Code of"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" Conduct** — Community standards and the private\nreporting channel\n- **Security Policy** —\nPrivate v"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ulnerability reporting and coordinated disclosure"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Self-Hosted & Private** — Deploy on your own infrastructure.\nKeep proprietary skills behind your"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" firewall with full data\nsovereignty. One `make dev-all` command to get running locally.\n- **Publish"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" & Version** — Upload agent skill packages with semantic\nversioning, custom tags (`beta`, `stable`),"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" and automatic\n`latest` tracking.\n- **Discover** — Full-text search with filters by namespace,\ndownl"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"oads, ratings, and recency. Visibility rules ensure\nusers only see what they're authorized to.\n- **T"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"eam Namespaces** — Organize skills under team or global scopes.\nEach namespace has its own members, "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"roles (Owner / Admin /\nMember), and publishing policies.\n- **Review & Governance** — Team admins rev"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"iew within their namespace;\nplatform admins gate promotions to the global scope. Governance\nactions "},{"id":"p14s9","text":"are audit-logged for compliance.\n- **Social Features** — Star skills, rate them, and track downloads"},{"id":"p14s10","text":".\nBuild a community around your organization's best practices.\n- **Account Merging** — Consolidate m"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"ultiple OAuth identities and\nAPI tokens under a single user account.\n- **API Token Management** — Ge"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"nerate scoped tokens for CLI and\nprogrammatic access with prefix-based secure hashing.\n- **CLI-First"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"** — Native REST API plus a compatibility layer for\nexisting ClawHub-style registry clients. Native "},{"id":"p14s14","text":"CLI APIs are the\nprimary supported path while protocol compatibility continues to\nexpand.\n- **Plugga"},{"id":"p14s15","text":"ble Storage** — Local filesystem for development, S3 /\nMinIO for production. Swap via config.\n- **In"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"ternationalization** — Multi-language support with i18next: English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, an"},{"id":"p14s17","text":"alization** — Multi-language support with i18next: English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, and Korean."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"To host your own registry using release images, start with:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The default command pulls the `latest` stable release images. Use `--version edge` if you want the n"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ewest build from `main`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Configure public URL (recommended for production):**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The `--public-url` parameter sets the public access URL for your SkillHub instance. This ensures:\n- "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"CLI install commands show the correct registry URL\n- Agent setup instructions display the correct sk"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ill.md URL\n- OAuth callbacks and device auth links work properly"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**For users in China (Aliyun mirror):**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Keep the existing runtime home when rerunning or updating the deployment. The\nruntime script reuses "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"its `.env.release` file; deleting the directory discards\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Docker & Docker Compose for container dependencies and release deployments\n- For source developmen"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"t: Java 21, Node.js 22.13+ (22.x) or 24.x, and the pnpm version declared in `web/package.json`\n- For"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" CLI development: Bun (see `cli/README.md`)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Backend (Spring Boot 3.2.3, Java 21):**\n- Multi-module Maven project with clean architecture\n- Mod"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ules: app, domain, auth, search, storage, infra\n- PostgreSQL with Flyway migrations (16 by default, "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"17 verified)\n- Redis for session management\n- S3/MinIO for skill package storage"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**Frontend (React 19, TypeScript, Vite):**\n- TanStack Router for routing\n- TanStack Query for data f"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"etching\n- Tailwind CSS + Radix UI for styling\n- OpenAPI TypeScript for type-safe API client\n- i18nex"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"t for internationalization"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
